                      <span style="font-size:14px">🥈</span>
                      <div style="flex:1"><div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#e2e8f0">Ana Reyes</div><div style="font-size:9px;color:#64748b">2nd Place</div></div>
                      <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#94a3b8">88.50%</span>
